# Low-power mode

msgid "Power"
msgstr "Power"

msgid "Low-power mode"
msgstr "Low-power mode"

msgid "Save battery and CPU: a calmer interface and a lighter sound engine."
msgstr "Save battery and CPU: a calmer interface and a lighter sound engine."

msgid "Animations are off: pages, menus and sliders switch instantly."
msgstr "Animations are off: pages, menus and sliders switch instantly."

msgid "Spectrum rays and the drifting glow stand still."
msgstr "Spectrum rays and the drifting glow stand still."

msgid "Sound effects are bypassed: equalizer, bass, treble, subsonic and normalization. Mono and playback speed keep working."
msgstr "Sound effects are bypassed: equalizer, bass, treble, subsonic and normalization. Mono and playback speed keep working."

msgid "AI stem separation (coming later) will stay off in this mode."
msgstr "AI stem separation (coming later) will stay off in this mode."

msgid "The playback engine wakes up less often and keeps a deeper buffer."
msgstr "The playback engine wakes up less often and keeps a deeper buffer."

msgid "Turns off what is only for looks or extra sound polish; everything else keeps working."
msgstr "Turns off what is only for looks or extra sound polish; everything else keeps working."

msgid "What changes"
msgstr "What changes"

msgid "On"
msgstr "On"

msgid "Low-power mode — tap to turn off"
msgstr "Low-power mode — tap to turn off"

msgid "Stems are not available in low-power mode"
msgstr "Stems are not available in low-power mode"
